  "note": "From the North Dakota Secretary of State's official sample ballot for Fargo precinct 44-01. Ballots for Casselton and West Fargo addresses list the same county contests, so they are countywide. Cass County commissioners are elected countywide; the district number is a residency seat. North Dakota does not mark incumbents on the ballot. The six district judges are on the Supreme Court's current East Central District roster. Incumbency for the county offices could not be confirmed because Cass County's website blocks automated access, so they are not marked. Also on every county ballot: a choice of County Official Newspaper (The Cass County Reporter or The Forum of Fargo-Moorhead). School district measures (including the Fargo Public School District No. 1 mill levy) depend on your school district and are not shown. There is no countywide or City of Fargo measure. Check your official sample ballot at vip.sos.nd.gov.",
